    <briefdescription>
<para>An unexpanded parameter pack (either in the expression or type context). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>If this AST is correct, this node will have a <ref refid="class_parameter_pack_expansion" kindref="compound">ParameterPackExpansion</ref> node above it.</para>
<para>This node is created when some &lt;template-args&gt; are found that apply to an &lt;encoding&gt;, and is stored in the TemplateParams table. In order for this to appear in the final AST, it has to referenced via a &lt;template-param&gt; (ie, T_). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
